0..72 Comment "// An annotation `(e : T)` states the type a value is read at: the whole"
73..150 Comment "// value of a definition no signature types is declared at `T`, and a value a"
151..228 Comment "// body returns is returned at `-F T`, whether the `return` is written or the"
229..300 Comment "// tail takes it. Anywhere else a value is read — a pair\'s component,"
301..371 Comment "// a scrutinee, an argument, an application\'s head, the value beside a"
372..451 Comment "// written signature — the value is ascribed `T` where it stands, and a tuple"
452..521 Comment "// a bind runs is ascribed the product its pattern is annotated with."
522..524 Comment "//"
525..540 Comment "// - see: #1107"
541..556 Comment "// - see: #1543"
557..598 Comment "// - see: #2168 — `injected`, `falsity`"
